    <p class="content-note">Holafly's number is a flat daily rate for unlimited data. Yesim's is a day-based or GB-based plan price, with the option to instead buy a Pay &amp; Fly balance from $1.10/GB. These aren't directly comparable units, but Holafly lands cheaper in every destination above, which tracks with Holafly sitting in our "Cheap" price bracket against Yesim's "Expensive."</p>
  </div>

